        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"grim88\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/c77e96/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> grim88:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>not to count plague rats before they've cracked, but when i play a 4 or 5 player game with friends, it usually takes about 2 hours or so and i've yet to defeat a level 3 villian.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Well, technically Plague Rat is a level 2…</p>",
