        "id": 72083,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-09-06T02:27:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Damage Dealt to Plague Rat by round.</p><p>Tempest: 3/1/5/5 = 14 damage (he also did 6 to the locust)</p><p>Wraith: 7/5/8/4 = 24 damage</p><p>Legacy: 3/3/3 = 9 damage</p><p>Ra: 3/5/5 = 13 damage</p><p>Fanatic: 4/2/10/6 = 22 damage</p><p>Ruins: 0/3/0 = 3 damage</p><p>That's a pretty sick game we just threw down, even just damage-wise.</p><p>The real kicker was Rat going -3 cards in the first round and losing a turn of damage. &nbsp;He really only played two cards in four rounds.</p><p>Otherwise he would have hit us all with infections when the font played and flipped and started healing. &nbsp;As is he still did 69 damage to us.</p>",
